#: ../../source/docs/development/mavcustmod.rst:3
#: a60e977f77264d4b9a73fc66c510c61b
msgid "Module Development"
msgstr "模块开发"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavcustmod.rst:5
#: 21bed270ea61423bb7dccc0ba35a5802
msgid ""
"This section is a quick tutorial on how to create custom modules in "
"MAVProxy."
msgstr "本节是关于如何在 MAVProxy 中创建自定义模块的快速教程。"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavcustmod.rst:9
#: 751b5145b6b2488d84b78c9aec186c79
msgid "Location"
msgstr "存放位置"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavcustmod.rst:11
#: ca75e1a104494a84927eaaad7255b74e
msgid ""
"If developing from the MAVProxy source code, modules are placed in the "
"``MAVProxy/modules`` folder. Then the ``setup.py build install --user`` "
"routine needs to be run in order to (re)install MAVProxy and the modules in "
"this folder which will be automatically picked up and become part of the "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"如果从 MAVProxy 源代码进行开发，模块应放置在 ``MAVProxy/modules`` 文件夹中。然后需要运行 ``setup.py "
"build install --user`` 以（重新）安装 MAVProxy 及该文件夹中的模块，这些模块将被自动识别并纳入安装包。"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavcustmod.rst:19
#: 997c84d60f564355909eb6d51037d13a
msgid ""
"MAVProxy modules will not be able to detect and run any modules not compiled"
" as part of the above ``setup.py``. This is because MAVProxy runs modules "
"from the Python package install directory, not the MAVProxy source code "
"directory."
msgstr ""
"MAVProxy 模块无法检测和运行未通过上述 ``setup.py`` 编译的模块。这是因为 MAVProxy 从 Python "
"包安装目录运行模块，而非 MAVProxy 源代码目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavcustmod.rst:24
#: 7eaef567071a4f589620a7f84fa1fbe1
msgid ""
"The module can then be loaded then using the ``module load myModule`` in "
"MAVProxy."
msgstr "然后可以在 MAVProxy 中使用 ``module load myModule`` 加载该模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/development/mavcustmod.rst:28
#: 99b84f49d7cd45d19bbd02406dba4890
msgid "Module File Structure"
msgstr "模块文件结构"

